Frankie's trained adapter layers and CPU VAD implementation are extracted from
its reference MLX implementation. Parakeet and Qwen3-TTS inference reuse the
parakeet-mlx and mlx-audio packages in the same process.

Breeze text-to-speech inference also reuses mlx-audio. Brain hidden states
condition its emotion instruction; generated text supplies the spoken words.
Breeze checkpoint license terms are retained with the model artifact.

